      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "A read barrier fixes up references as the app loads them.",
      "narration": "While the collector runs, apps may load references to objects not yet copied. A read barrier on each reference load fixes those up on the spot.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Read barrier",
